# NOITE's sauna (3fsauna) with the Corrigida's arcade game: a right click plays
# the attendant once and his wave, whose end launches the real SAUNA; NOITE gets
# 0x40c at 3965 and hides; SAUNA shows its controls screen, which a key takes down
# at 6000, and the arcade game plays the 46 arrow presses planned by
# `tools/sauna_plan.py --arcade --start 6000 --min-eaten 1` (a ghost eaten under
# the power of a cork). SAUNA reports won 11100 (9600 + 500 + 1000) at 46512; NOITE
# shows itself, adds it and goes to the hall (3fhall) with its 3 lives.
#
